========================================================================================
LRC(14) seven-sector cap scout
========================================================================================

[0] Sufficient route
    N(E) = {all gaps <= 1/7}.
    S7(E)= {fixed sectors 0..6 are all hit by {e*x}}.
    Up to boundary measure zero, N(E) subset S7(E).
    Therefore meas(S7(E)) <= cap_k implies mu_1/7(E) >= 1-cap_k.

[1] cap_k = min_{|P|=13-k} meas(G_P)
