Verdict:
    Sector cover gives a weaker cap target than consecutive-mu minimization.
    The bounded exact bank has no violations, with large rational margins.
    LRC(14) is not proved: the missing lemma is a global sector-cover cap
    or a finite low-height reduction plus high-height sector discrepancy tail.
